    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. Could you go into a bit more detail on that second point about the movement of people? Like, what kind of specific specialized skills or technologies were being passed around that actually changed how local economies functioned? I want to give my students some concrete examples.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
